          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "廣域規則也會在更長的詞裡面觸發；這些詞典裡的詞會當反例加入，整句含有它們時規則就不套用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A broad rule for %@ needs “Any context” chosen for that candidate; only this sentence or a context-locked rule was authorised.": {
