    "Environment variables available: VOICEINK_SYSTEM_PROMPT, VOICEINK_USER_PROMPT, VOICEINK_FULL_PROMPT. Custom commands can also read VOICEINK_FULL_PROMPT from stdin.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verfügbare Umgebungsvariablen: VOICEINK_SYSTEM_PROMPT, VOICEINK_USER_PROMPT, VOICEINK_FULL_PROMPT. Benutzerdefinierte Befehle können VOICEINK_FULL_PROMPT auch aus stdin lesen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Variables d’environnement disponibles : VOICEINK_SYSTEM_PROMPT, VOICEINK_USER_PROMPT, VOICEINK_FULL_PROMPT. Les commandes personnalisées peuvent aussi lire VOICEINK_FULL_PROMPT depuis stdin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可用的环境变量：VOICEINK_SYSTEM_PROMPT、VOICEINK_USER_PROMPT、VOICEINK_FULL_PROMPT。自定义命令也可以从 stdin 读取 VOICEINK_FULL_PROMPT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Environment variables available: VOICEINK_SYSTEM_PROMPT, VOICEINK_USER_PROMPT, VOICEINK_FULL_PROMPT. Voco also writes VOICEINK_FULL_PROMPT to stdin for every command.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
