    "Find-issues never creates broad rules or moves/merges families (%@: %@ → %@). Tick the candidate and choose “Any context”, or state yourself that the source is never valid and send again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找問題不會建立廣泛規則，也不會搬移或合併群組（%1$@：%2$@ → %3$@）。請勾選該候選並選「任何語境」，或自己說明來源在任何語境都不成立再送一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find-issues never creates broad rules or moves/merges families (%@: %@ → %@). Tick the candidate first and change the correction draft's scope on its card, or state yourself that the source is never valid and send again.": {
