    "That replacement would create a loop between existing rules": {
      "comment": "Error shown when saving a word replacement would make two rules replace each other in a loop.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Ersetzung würde eine Schleife zwischen bestehenden Regeln erzeugen"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce remplacement créerait une boucle entre les règles existantes"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该替换会在现有规则之间形成循环"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI announced options without the question JSON; asking it to add them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 說要讓你勾選卻沒附 question JSON，請它補上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI answered the choice without a draft or question JSON; asking it to add one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 回覆了勾選結果，但沒附草稿或 question JSON，請它補上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI listed a rule plan without the draft JSON; asking it to add them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 列出了規則計畫，但沒附草稿 JSON，請它補上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI lists the places it suspects; tick the ones that are wrong.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 會列出它懷疑的地方，勾選真的有錯的即可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI proposed a draft with incomplete or unsafe fields (%@); it was not listed for confirmation. Add more detail and send again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 提出的草稿欄位不完整或不安全（%@），未列出供確認。請補充細節後重新送出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI provider stopped before completing the enhancement.": {
      "comment": "Error message when the AI provider stops processing the input before completion.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der KI-Anbieter wurde beendet, bevor die Verbesserung abgeschlossen war."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fournisseur d’IA s’est arrêté avant de terminer l’amélioration."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 提供商在完成增强之前已停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI provider's server encountered an error. Please try again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beim Server des KI-Anbieters ist ein Fehler aufgetreten. Bitte versuche es später erneut."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le serveur du fournisseur d'IA a rencontré une erreur. Veuillez réessayer plus tard."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 提供商的服务器发生错误。请稍后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI reply was cut off by the length limit; please send again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 回覆被長度上限截斷，請重新送出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI response exceeded the safety length limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 回應超過安全長度上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI returned an invalid Auto Learn review response.": {
      "comment": "Error shown when an AI response for Dictionary Auto Learn cannot be validated.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die KI hat eine ungültige Antwort für die automatische Wörterbuchprüfung zurückgegeben."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'IA a renvoyé une réponse de révision d'apprentissage automatique non valide."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 返回了无效的词典自动学习审核响应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI scans the record once per conversation and lists suspected errors as options to tick. Turn this off to start every conversation by hand.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 每段對話會掃描一次這筆紀錄，把懷疑的錯誤列成選項讓你勾。關閉後每段對話都由你自己開始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI used more than %lld tool rounds; please rephrase and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 使用了超過 %lld 輪工具呼叫，請換個說法再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The API request failed with status code %lld: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die API-Anfrage ist mit Statuscode %lld fehlgeschlagen: %@"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La demande d'API a échoué avec le code d'état %lld : %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API 请求失败，状态码 %lld：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The API returned an empty or invalid response.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die API hat eine leere oder ungültige Antwort zurückgegeben."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'API a renvoyé une réponse vide ou non valide."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API 返回了空响应或无效响应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Great Gatsby": {
      "comment": "Literary benchmark title used in the dashboard momentum comparison.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der große Gatsby"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le magnifique Gatsby"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "了不起的盖茨比"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The MCP session is closed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MCP 連線已關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Metamorphosis": {
      "comment": "Literary benchmark title used in the dashboard momentum comparison.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Verwandlung"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La métamorphose"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "变形记"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker already has an identical event (%lld); not writing again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worker 已有相同事件（%lld 筆），不再重複寫入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker cannot publish this event type in realtime (unsupported=%lld, skipped=%lld): %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worker 無法即時發佈這種事件類型（unsupported=%1$lld、skipped=%2$lld）：%3$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker did not offer any rule tools.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worker 沒有提供任何規則工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker duplicate check matched an existing or retired rule for the same pattern, but the preview confirms this adds a runtime policy; letting it through.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worker 查重比對到同一個模式的既有或已退場規則，但預覽確認這會新增一條 runtime 規則，所以放行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker has no policy with policyId %@, so sourcePattern/targetText cannot be filled in; propose it again with sourcePattern + targetText.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worker 找不到 policyId %@ 對應的規則，無法補 sourcePattern／targetText；請改用 sourcePattern＋targetText 重新提出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker preview says this would not change the model: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worker 預覽顯示這不會改變模型：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker published %@, but the Mac sync SHA does not match (remote=%@, installed=%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worker 已發佈 %1$@，但 Mac 同步的 SHA 不符（遠端＝%2$@，已安裝＝%3$@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker published %@, but the Mac sync did not complete: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worker 已發佈 %1$@，但 Mac 同步未完成：%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker published %@; syncing the Mac model…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worker 已發佈 %@，正在同步 Mac 模型…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker published and the Mac model is in sync (SHA %@). The canonical ReplayLab merge is handled separately.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worker 已發佈，Mac 模型已同步（SHA %@）。正式的 ReplayLab 整併會另外處理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker realtime overlay did not carry a valid published SHA.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worker 的即時覆層沒有帶有效的已發佈 SHA。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker recorded the event (%@) but did not publish: %@. The event stays pending on the Worker and will not be resent; resolve the cause first (for example, retire the conflicting rule).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worker 已記錄事件（%1$@）但未發佈：%2$@。事件會以待處理狀態留在 Worker，不會重送；請先排除原因（例如停用衝突的規則）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker recorded the event (pending) but did not publish it in realtime: %@. It will not be resent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worker 已記錄事件（待處理），但未即時發佈：%@。不會重送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker recorded the event, but this rule did not change the model (%@). It will not be resent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worker 已記錄事件，但這條規則沒有改變模型（%@）。不會重送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker rejected the write: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worker 拒絕寫入：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker sync key is not configured on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這台 Mac 尚未設定 Worker 同步金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker sync key is not configured on this Mac; rules cannot be published.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這台 Mac 尚未設定 Worker 同步金鑰，無法發佈規則。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker write outcome is unknown (%@). Moves and merges cannot be duplicate-checked, so the transaction was not resent; confirm with lookup_auto_apply_policy or the Worker reconcile state before asking again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worker 寫入結果不明（%@）。搬移與合併無法查重，所以交易不會重送；再次操作前請用 lookup_auto_apply_policy 或 Worker 對帳狀態確認。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker write outcome is unknown (%@); the duplicate check did not find this rule, so nothing was resent. Press Confirm & Publish again — the full check runs before writing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worker 寫入結果不明（%@）；查重也找不到這條規則，所以沒有重送。再按一次「確認並發佈」，寫入前會重新完整檢查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker write response was lost, but the duplicate check shows the rule already exists; it was not resent. Use Resync Mac model shortly to confirm the Mac model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worker 寫入回應遺失，但查重顯示規則已存在，所以沒有重送。稍後用「重新同步 Mac 模型」確認 Mac 端模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Worker's matching event belongs to a rule a tombstone already retired, and the preview confirms this adds a runtime policy; letting it through.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worker 比對到的事件屬於已被 tombstone 停用的規則，且預覽確認這會新增一條 runtime 規則，所以放行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app '%@' is already configured in the '%@' mode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die App '%@' ist bereits im Modus '%@' konfiguriert."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'application '%@' est déjà configurée en mode '%@'."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App「%@」已在「%@」模式中配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The arrow icon refers to Word Replacement. The book icon refers to Vocabulary.": {
      "comment": "Help text identifying the icons in the correction review panel.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Pfeilsymbol steht für Wortersetzung. Das Buchsymbol steht für Vokabular."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'icône en forme de flèche fait référence au remplacement de mots. L'icône du livre fait référence au vocabulaire."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "箭头图标表示文字替换。书本图标表示词汇表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assigned shortcut cancels the recording. Resetting restores the default double-Escape behavior.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der zugewiesene Kurzbefehl bricht die Aufnahme ab. Durch Zurücksetzen wird das standardmäßige zweimalige Drücken von Escape wiederhergestellt."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le raccourci attribué annule l’enregistrement. La réinitialisation rétablit le double appui sur Échap par défaut."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指定的快捷键会取消录音。重置后将恢复默认的连按两次 Escape 操作。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指定的快捷鍵會取消錄音。重設後會恢復預設的雙按 Esc 行為。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The audio file is invalid or corrupted": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Audiodatei ist ungültig oder beschädigt"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fichier audio est invalide ou corrompu"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "音频文件无效或已损坏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The audio file to transcribe could not be found.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die zu transkribierende Audiodatei konnte nicht gefunden werden."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fichier audio à transcrire est introuvable."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找不到要转写的音频文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The audio format is not supported": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Audioformat wird nicht unterstützt"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le format audio n'est pas pris en charge"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持该音频格式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The configured AI enhancement provider cannot review Auto Learn candidates.": {
      "comment": "Error shown when the configured AI provider cannot perform Dictionary Auto Learn review.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der konfigurierte KI-Verbesserungsanbieter kann Kandidaten für das automatische Lernen nicht prüfen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fournisseur d’amélioration de l’IA configuré ne peut pas examiner les candidats à l’apprentissage automatique."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已配置的 AI 增强提供商无法审核自动学习候选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The core transcription engine failed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Kern-Transkriptionsengine ist fehlgeschlagen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le moteur de transcription principal est tombé en panne."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "核心转写引擎运行失败。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The corrected value cannot be empty.": {
      "comment": "A validation error message.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der korrigierte Wert darf nicht leer sein."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La valeur corrigée ne peut pas être vide."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更正后的值不能为空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The dictionary changed while preparing the import. Review it and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Wörterbuch wurde während der Importvorbereitung geändert. Überprüfe es und versuche es erneut."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le dictionnaire a changé lors de la préparation de l'import. Vérifiez-le et réessayez."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "准备导入时词典发生了更改。请检查后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The dictionary could not be saved: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Wörterbuch konnte nicht gespeichert werden: %@"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le dictionnaire n'a pas pu être enregistré : %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法保存词典：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The downloaded Core ML model archive might be corrupted. Try deleting the model and downloading it again. Check available disk space.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das heruntergeladene Core-ML-Modellarchiv ist möglicherweise beschädigt. Lösche das Modell und lade es erneut herunter. Prüfe den verfügbaren Speicherplatz."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'archive du modèle Core ML téléchargée est peut-être corrompue. Essayez de supprimer le modèle et de le télécharger à nouveau. Vérifiez l'espace disque disponible."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载的 Core ML 模型压缩包可能已损坏。请尝试删除该模型后重新下载。请检查可用磁盘空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The downloaded file for %@ failed integrity verification.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Integritätsprüfung der heruntergeladenen Datei für %@ ist fehlgeschlagen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fichier téléchargé pour %@ a échoué à la vérification de l'intégrité."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载的 %@ 文件未通过完整性验证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The downloaded size for %@ was %lld bytes instead of %lld bytes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die heruntergeladene Größe für %1$@ betrug %2$lld Byte statt %3$lld Byte."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The downloaded size for %1$@ was %2$lld bytes instead of %3$lld bytes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La taille téléchargée pour %1$@ était d’octets %2$lld au lieu d’octets %3$lld."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 的下载大小为 %2$lld 字节，而不是 %3$lld 字节。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The emoji \"%@\" is currently used by one or more Power Modes and cannot be removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "表情符號「%@」目前有一個或多個強力模式正在使用，無法移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The imported settings file (version %@) is from a different version than your application (version %@). Proceeding with import, but be aware of potential incompatibilities.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die importierte Einstellungsdatei (Version %@) stammt aus einer anderen Version als deine Anwendung (Version %@). Der Import wird fortgesetzt, mögliche Inkompatibilitäten sind jedoch zu beachten."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fichier de paramètres importé (version %@) provient d'une version différente de celle de votre application (version %@). Poursuivez l'importation, mais soyez conscient des incompatibilités potentielles."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导入的设置文件（版本 %@）与你的 App（版本 %@）版本不同。将继续导入，但请注意可能存在的不兼容问题。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匯入的設定檔版本（%1$@）與目前 app 版本（%2$@）不同。會繼續匯入，但可能有相容性問題。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key is stored only in this Mac's Keychain and is sent to OpenCode Go only. It never goes to the Worker, into model payloads, logs, or UserDefaults.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "金鑰只存在這台 Mac 的鑰匙圈，而且只會送給 OpenCode Go；不會送給 Worker，也不會出現在模型內容、log 或 UserDefaults。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key worked, but VoiceInk could not save it securely.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Schlüssel funktioniert, aber VoiceInk konnte ihn nicht sicher speichern."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The key worked, but Voco could not save it securely."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La clé a fonctionné, mais VoiceInk n'a pas pu la sauvegarder en toute sécurité."
