    "Turn this on if local transcriptions take longer than expected. It prepares the selected model in the background when the app launches or wakes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktiviere diese Option, wenn lokale Transkriptionen länger als erwartet dauern. Das ausgewählte Modell wird beim Start oder Aufwachen der App im Hintergrund vorbereitet."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activez cette option si les transcriptions locales prennent plus de temps que prévu. Il prépare le modèle sélectionné en arrière-plan lorsque l'application se lance ou se réveille."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果本地转写耗时超出预期，请开启此选项。App 启动或唤醒时会在后台准备所选模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn this on if transcriptions with local models (including Whisper MLX) are taking longer than expected. Runs silent background transcription on app launch and wake to trigger optimization.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果本機模型（包括 Whisper MLX）的轉錄時間超出預期，請開啟此選項。會在應用程式啟動和喚醒時執行靜默背景轉錄以觸發最佳化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn this on if transcriptions with local models are taking longer than expected. Runs silent background transcription on app launch and wake to trigger optimization.": {
      "localizations": {
