            "value": "先選取相關文字或開啟相關視窗再用這個。Voco 會用那些脈絡寫出清楚的郵件草稿。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use this for answers, summaries, and follow-ups. Instead of pasting, Voco keeps the conversation inside the recorder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用於回答、摘要與追問。Voco 不貼上結果，而是把對話留在錄音器裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use this for answers, summaries, and follow-ups. Instead of pasting, VoiceInk keeps the conversation inside the recorder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use this for answers, summaries, and follow-ups. Instead of pasting, Voco keeps the conversation inside the recorder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用於回答、摘要與追問。Voco 不貼上結果，而是把對話留在錄音器裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use this for everyday writing when you want grammar, flow, and light formatting improved before the result is pasted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日常書寫時用這個，在貼上結果之前先改善語法、流暢度與輕量格式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use this when you have text selected and want a stronger version. The selected text is available as context for the rewrite.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已選取文字、想要更有力的版本時用這個。選取的文字會作為改寫的脈絡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use this when you want the quickest possible voice-to-text result. It records with Parakeet V3 and pastes the transcript as-is.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "想要最快的語音轉文字時用這個。它以 Parakeet V3 錄音，並原樣貼上轉錄結果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use this when you want the quickest possible voice-to-text result. It records with your configured transcription model and pastes the transcript as-is.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verwende dies, wenn du möglichst schnell Sprache in Text umwandeln möchtest. Es nimmt mit deinem konfigurierten Transkriptionsmodell auf und fügt das Transkript unverändert ein."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisez-le lorsque vous souhaitez obtenir le résultat voix-texte le plus rapide possible. Il enregistre avec votre modèle de transcription configuré et colle la transcription telle quelle."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当你想尽快将语音转换为文本时使用此模式。它会使用你配置的转写模型录音，并按原样粘贴转写内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
