          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VoiceInk automatically learns from the corrections you make to improve transcription accuracy over time. Dictionary Auto Learn uses your currently configured AI provider and AI model. You can change them anytime in Dictionary Settings.": {
      "comment": "Description of Dictionary Auto Learn in the What's New panel.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk lernt automatisch aus deinen Korrekturen, um die Transkriptionsgenauigkeit mit der Zeit zu verbessern. Die automatische Wörterbucherweiterung verwendet deinen derzeit konfigurierten KI-Anbieter und dein KI-Modell. Du kannst beides jederzeit in den Wörterbucheinstellungen ändern."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voco automatically learns from the corrections you make to improve transcription accuracy over time. Dictionary Auto Learn uses your currently configured AI provider and AI model. You can change them anytime in Dictionary Settings."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk apprend automatiquement des corrections que vous apportez pour améliorer la précision de la transcription au fil du temps. Dictionary Auto Learn utilise votre fournisseur d'IA et votre modèle d'IA actuellement configurés. Vous pouvez les modifier à tout moment dans les paramètres du dictionnaire."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk 会自动学习你所做的更正，从而逐步提高转录准确度。词典自动学习会使用你当前配置的 AI 提供商和 AI 模型。你可以随时在“词典”设置中更改它们。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voco 會自動從你做過的修正中學習，逐步提升轉錄準確度。詞庫自動學習會使用你目前設定的 AI 供應商與 AI 模型。你可以隨時在詞庫設定中變更。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VoiceInk automatically switches to this mode based on the app or website you're using, or when you say a trigger word during recording.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk wechselt automatisch in diesen Modus, abhängig von der verwendeten App oder Website oder wenn du während der Aufnahme ein Auslösewort sagst."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voco automatically switches to this mode based on the app or website you're using, or when you say a trigger word during recording."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk passe automatiquement à ce mode selon l’application ou le site web que vous utilisez, ou lorsque vous prononcez un mot déclencheur pendant l’enregistrement."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk 会根据你正在使用的 App 或网站自动切换到此模式，也会在你录音时说出触发词后切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VoiceInk automatically switches to this mode when you use the apps or websites you add here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voco automatically switches to this mode when you use the apps or websites you add here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "當你使用這裡新增的 App 或網站時，Voco 會自動切換到這個模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VoiceInk automatically understands what you are working with and selects your preferred setup. You can always configure this by editing or creating new modes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk erkennt automatisch, woran du arbeitest, und wählt deine bevorzugte Konfiguration aus. Du kannst dies jederzeit anpassen, indem du Modi bearbeitest oder neue erstellst."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voco automatically understands what you are working with and selects your preferred setup. You can always configure this by editing or creating new modes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk comprend automatiquement avec quoi vous travaillez et sélectionne votre configuration préférée. Vous pouvez toujours configurer cela en modifiant ou en créant de nouveaux modes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk 会自动识别你正在处理的内容，并选用你偏好的设置。你随时可以通过编辑或创建新模式来进行配置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voco 會自動理解你正在進行的工作，並選取你偏好的設定。你可以隨時編輯或建立新模式來調整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VoiceInk can select the right mode from the app you are using and the rules you configure.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk kann anhand der verwendeten App und der konfigurierten Regeln den passenden Modus auswählen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voco can select the right mode from the app you are using and the rules you configure."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk peut sélectionner le bon mode à partir de l'application que vous utilisez et des règles que vous configurez."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk 可以根据你正在使用的 App 和你配置的规则选择合适的模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VoiceInk cannot initialize its storage system. The app cannot continue.\n\nPlease try reinstalling the app or contact support if the issue persists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voco cannot initialize its storage system. The app cannot continue.\n\nPlease try reinstalling the app or contact support if the issue persists."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voco 無法初始化儲存系統，應用程式無法繼續。\n\n請嘗試重新安裝應用程式，若問題仍然存在請聯繫支援。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VoiceInk could not switch to another microphone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk konnte nicht zu einem anderen Mikrofon wechseln."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voco could not switch to another microphone."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk n'a pas pu passer à un autre microphone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk 无法切换到其他麦克风。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VoiceInk couldn't access its storage location. Your transcriptions will not be saved between sessions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk konnte nicht auf den Speicherort zugreifen. Deine Transkriptionen werden nicht zwischen Sitzungen gespeichert."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voco couldn't access its storage location. Your transcriptions will not be saved between sessions."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk n'a pas pu accéder à son emplacement de stockage. Vos transcriptions ne seront pas enregistrées entre les sessions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk 无法访问其存储位置。你的转写记录将无法跨会话存储。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voco 無法存取其儲存位置。您的轉錄紀錄將不會在工作階段之間保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VoiceInk couldn't access the macOS Keychain. Quit and reopen VoiceInk. If the problem continues, restart your Mac.": {
      "comment": "Error message displayed when the macOS Keychain is unavailable.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk konnte nicht auf den macOS-Schlüsselbund zugreifen. Beende VoiceInk und öffne die App erneut. Falls das Problem weiterhin besteht, starte deinen Mac neu."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voco couldn't access the macOS Keychain. Quit and reopen Voco. If the problem continues, restart your Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk n'a pas pu accéder au trousseau macOS. Quittez et rouvrez VoiceInk. Si le problème persiste, redémarrez votre Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk 无法访问 macOS 钥匙串。请退出并重新打开 VoiceInk。如果问题仍然存在，请重新启动 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VoiceInk couldn't remove the saved license. Please try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk konnte die gespeicherte Lizenz nicht entfernen. Bitte versuche es erneut."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voco couldn't remove the saved license. Please try again."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk n'a pas pu supprimer la licence enregistrée. Veuillez réessayer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk 无法移除已保存的许可证。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VoiceInk couldn't save the license. Please try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk konnte die Lizenz nicht speichern. Bitte versuche es erneut."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voco couldn't save the license. Please try again."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk n'a pas pu enregistrer la licence. Veuillez réessayer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk 无法保存许可证。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VoiceInk couldn't start the trial because the macOS Keychain is unavailable. Quit and reopen VoiceInk. If the problem continues, restart your Mac.": {
      "comment": "Error message displayed when the macOS Keychain is unavailable while starting a trial.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VoiceInk konnte den Testzeitraum nicht starten, da der macOS-Schlüsselbund nicht verfügbar ist. Beende VoiceInk und öffne die App erneut. Falls das Problem weiterhin besteht, starte deinen Mac neu."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voco couldn't start the trial because the macOS Keychain is unavailable. Quit and reopen Voco. If the problem continues, restart your Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
